      "side": 1,
      "message": "There may have been a race condition with the Intel altmode driver.  The altmode driver was responsible for triggering the mux change to the kernel.  If we waited to read the DP config VDO until we reached steady state, we didn\u0027t have the DP pin assignment to report to the kernel.\n\nWith the switch to the PMC-PD path, this may no longer be needed.",
